tidal-dowloader
Copyright the tidal-dowloader contributors

This product is a Node.js/Express re-implementation of parts of
"Tidal-Media-Downloader" (https://github.com/yaronzz/Tidal-Media-Downloader),
Copyright Yaron Huang (yaronzz), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The download/decrypt/tagging pipeline, the Tidal API client, and the OAuth2
device-code login flow are ported from that project's Python source.

That project itself credits, for the pieces this app also relies on:
- Decryption routine: adapted from "RedSea" (https://github.com/redsudo/RedSea).
- Reverse-engineered OAuth2 device-flow client identifiers:
  - Fokka-Engineering / libopenTIDAL
    (https://github.com/Fokka-Engineering/libopenTIDAL)
  - Dniel97 / RedSea
    (https://github.com/Dniel97/RedSea)
  - morguldir / python-tidal
    (https://github.com/morguldir/python-tidal)
  - 1nikolas (via https://github.com/yaronzz/Tidal-Media-Downloader/pull/840)
- aigpy (https://github.com/yaronzz/AIGPY) and python-tidal
  (https://github.com/tamland/python-tidal) as general references.

See the LICENSE file for the full Apache License 2.0 text.
